  "content": "<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">在遊戲中新增了可馴服的狐獴，當你需要時，牠們會戰鬥並保護你。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">牠們是雜食動物，所以什麼都能吃。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">你可以用任何食物來馴服和繁殖牠們。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">如果未經馴服，牠們會逃離玩家和怪物，但你可以用食物引誘牠們靠近你。</span></p><p><br><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">你可以在稀樹草原生態域中找到牠們。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">（在 Forge 中，你可以透過編輯資料 -> 生態域標籤和生態域修改器資料夾中的 JSON 檔案，或透過資源包來更改此設定及其他生成設定；而在 Fabric 中則有對應的設定檔。）</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">模組目前支援的版本</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><strong>Forge&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;26.x | 1.21.11 | 1.21.10 | 1.21.9 | 1.21.8 | 1.21.7 | 1.21.6 | 1.21.5 | 1.21.4 | 1.21.1 | 1.20.1</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><strong>Fabric&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 26.x | 1.21.11 |1.21.10 | 1.21.9 | 1.21.8 | 1.21.7 | 1.21.6 | 1.21.5 | 1.21.4 | 1.21.1 | 1.20.1</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><strong>Neoforge 26.x | 1.21.11 |1.21.10 | 1.21.9 | 1.21.8 | 1.21.7 | 1.21.6 | 1.21.4 | 1.21.1</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">&nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1105/8/ezgif-7c80eb91372f56.gif\" alt=\"動畫展示\" width=\"400\" height=\"400\"></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"color:#f60;font-size:14px\"><strong>如果你需要在 CurseForge 上使用不同版本的模組，請私訊給我</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"color:#f60;font-size:14px\"><a style=\"color:#f60\" href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/members/aquarius_playz/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://legacy.curseforge.com/members/aquarius_playz/projects</a></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"color:#00f;font-size:14px\"><strong>在 X（Twitter）上追蹤我</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"color:#00f;font-size:14px\"><a style=\"color:#00f\" href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://x.com/Aquarius_playz\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://x.com/Aquarius_playz</a></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/aquarius-libs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/1577/494/639022024300181764.png\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\"></a></span></p><p><span style=\"color:#f00;font-size:18px\"><a style=\"color:#f00;font-size:18px\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/aquarius-libs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>此模組需要安裝 AquariusLibs 才能執行</strong></a></span></p>",
